      "sha": "1a57943e6",
      "refs": {
        "paths": [
          "src/app/golf/actions/insights.ts"
        ],
        "globs": [],
        "identifiers": []
      },
      "verified": "exists"
    },
    {
      "id": "c55-ledger_entry",
      "kind": "ledger_entry",
      "text": "## 2026-08-26 — Ask surface: no keyboard-on-open, honest empty pulse\n\n- SHA: 596913022.\n- Change: the Ask composer autofocus (CoachHelmChat `variant==='page' &&\n  isEmpty`) now also requires a fine pointer; ProgramOpening renders a\n  compact EmptyState (+ coverage line) instead of `return null` when the\n  pulse has no items. Regression tests: ProgramOpening.empty.test.tsx;\n  feature doc UI-contract updated same day.\n- Why: owner TestFlight report — opening Ask on iPhone popped the keyboard\n  over a page that was mostly blank cream, because an empty pulse left the\n  flex-1 opening region stretching around nothing while the route skeleton\n  had promised a findings list.",
